261	  /// The file count is deliberately NOT inside the line-counts branch. `lineCountsHelp` is nil for an
262	  /// untracked-only dirty tree, which is exactly a case where files changed and no `+/−` can be
263	  /// computed — the count is the only thing there is to say, so it has to render on its own.
